ind theoretisch in Zukunft denkbar und werden von diesem Code nicht miterfasst.</td></tr><tr><td>Ra-223</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>24853006 (Radium-223 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Ac-225</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>32059002 (Actinium-225 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Sm-153</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>419804008 (Samarium-153 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Tb-161</td><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td>Sr-89</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>7770004 (Strontium-89 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Ir-192</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>48341001 (Iridium-192 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Co-60</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>5405008 (Cobalt-60 (substance))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>SONU (Sonstige Nuklide)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>89457008 (Radioactive isotope (substance))</td><td/></tr></table></div>"
